WEBVTT

00:03:57.350 --> 00:04:00.686
just how deeply rooted your urge to solve is,

00:04:00.686 --> 00:04:03.185
just how wired to solve all of you really are,

00:04:03.185 --> 00:04:04.627
so I'm going to come into the audience

00:04:04.627 --> 00:04:07.625
and find somebody to help me.

00:04:07.625 --> 00:04:09.747
Let's see.

00:04:09.747 --> 00:04:13.639
Everybody's looking away all of a sudden.

00:04:13.639 --> 00:04:17.556
Can I? Would you? What is your name? Gwen.

00:04:17.556 --> 00:04:19.997
I'm not a mind reader, I can see your name tag.

00:04:19.997 --> 00:04:24.310
Come with me, Gwen. Everyone give her 
a round of applause, make her feel welcome.

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:25.982
Gwen, after you.

00:04:25.982 --> 00:04:27.864
(Applause)

00:04:27.864 --> 00:04:31.275
Are you so excited?